      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELLA KNOWS (1) showed good early burn but run over late to finish 7th at this track in Grade 4/5 company. Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Should be very hard to beat this time. IT'S A TEASE (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.25) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including seven wins. Can do much better this time. KILCOY TIGER (4) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 400m behind Red Reign (23.62) in a NG. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. CRANKY CRUISER (2) is not to be discarded.",
